Field Review - Outdoor Uses (No Buildings Proposed) - In accordance with Section 4.4 of the Zoning and Development By-law, your request is granted, thereby permitting:
- alterations to landscaping features (gates and posts);
- additions of a water feature; and
- a deck and hot tub at the rear of the property to the existing one-family dwelling with an attached three-car garage having vehicular access from Laurier Avenue;
